          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "CHROMAKEY\nThis node can be used to key a certain hue out of a texture. In the example you can see how scrolling through the key hue parameter keys out different hues. This is the basis for your chromakey. All the other parameters are there to perfect your keying."
          }
